## 🔄 Learning Approach

```text
Learn
  ↓
Understand
  ↓
Write
  ↓
Run
  ↓
Practice
  ↓
Debug
  ↓
Improve
  ↓
Upload to GitHub
```

I focus on understanding the concepts and writing programs myself instead of simply copying code.

